  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>and <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is continuous at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Clearly,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo></math>Equating coefficient&nbsp;of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>)</mo></math></p>"
